Q. 5 Comprehend the following recursive codes and write the output showing all intermediate steps.
[CO 1(Understanding), 3 Marks]

a) 
```c
#include<stdio.h>
void abc1(int);
void abc2(int);
void abc1(int num)
{
if(num==0)
return;
printf("%d", num);
abc2(num-3);
printf("%d",num);
}
```
```c
void abc2(int num){
if(num==0) return;
printf("%d",num);
abc1(-num);
printf("%d",num);
}
int main()
{
abc1(7);
return 0;
}
```

